# Paths that still exist in both web/src and packages/cybion-components/src.
#
# This list only shrinks: delete an entry when the module is collapsed into the
# package, never add one. The check that reads it also fails on a stale entry,
# so a removed duplicate cannot linger here.
#
# styles.css is not a duplicate in the harmful sense: web's copy is the app's
# own theme, the package's copy ships the component styles.
